{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play an apprentice of the solver's guild. Solvers are the most important people in this world because puzzle storms are rising all over the place, making people's lives harder. You're challenged with graduating your solver's exam by saving the princess from the nearby castle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869290/extras/4dc8941d591b3318eefaa6d343b3ed1c.poster.avif?t=1771371034\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869290/extras/4dc8941d591b3318eefaa6d343b3ed1c.webm?t=1771371034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869290/extras/4dc8941d591b3318eefaa6d343b3ed1c.mp4?t=1771371034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supraworld is a First-Person-Puzzle-Metroidvania. The interconnected world will expand the more upgrades and abilities you find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is filled to the brim with secret areas for you to find. Instead of invisible walls blocking you everywhere, the geometry you see is exactly what you get and what you can use for your traversal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869290/extras/10ae6b41c84e508c3f8f690c514f53f9.poster.avif?t=1771371034\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869290/extras/10ae6b41c84e508c3f8f690c514f53f9.webm?t=1771371034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869290/extras/10ae6b41c84e508c3f8f690c514f53f9.mp4?t=1771371034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is pretty much no useless decoration in the game. Everything you see is there for a specific reason; and it's not to clutter up your monitor with useless details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new addition to the franchise are detective cases. In those you're freely deducing who commited one of five murders and you're free to lock up whoever you think is the culprit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869290/extras/e5e1f71c873c387733e9bf9abae54e9a.poster.avif?t=1771371034\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869290/extras/e5e1f71c873c387733e9bf9abae54e9a.webm?t=1771371034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869290/extras/e5e1f71c873c387733e9bf9abae54e9a.mp4?t=1771371034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the time is spent exploring, solving puzzles and doing detective work. Combat is a relatively small part of the game and is sometimes also puzzle heavy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869290/extras/8c72ecb6eb7b6c6e463e7f3f77eef51d.poster.avif?t=1771371034\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869290/extras/8c72ecb6eb7b6c6e463e7f3f77eef51d.webm?t=1771371034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869290/extras/8c72ecb6eb7b6c6e463e7f3f77eef51d.mp4?t=1771371034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supraworld trusts you to be clever and is not holding your hand. Therefore the target audience are experienced players who are tired of the same old generic adventure games and are longing for something that challenges and surprises them in new ways</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Gun with the wind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1869290/a9a8f07b0b86b7348a53be11abbebc80f2df626f.jpg"},{"name":"Castle 2nd Floor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1869290/055f96fd1fa7ece9b653175080ae76caf56dbdc9.jpg"},{"name":"Castle Top","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1869290/055f96fd1fa7ece9b653175080ae76caf56dbdc9.jpg"},{"name":"Castle Unlocked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1869290/10e94066690e57001d1735217f54514dbf45c327.jpg"},{"name":"High","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1869290/3c3f389f0a0cf4d05f32bae5b62d9684391e261a.jpg"},{"name":"Crouch Egg","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1869290/a9a8f07b0b86b7348a53be11abbebc80f2df626f.jpg"},{"name":"Dash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1869290/18413cdb4844f834336239df0e8b9fd1a7215d50.jpg"},{"name":"Egg Opener","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1869290/a9a8f07b0b86b7348a53be11abbebc80f2df626f.jpg"},{"name":"Fashion Designer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1869290/6978613895a835f80bf0c79178db524371c471c0.jpg"},{"name":"Ghost Egg","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1869290/a9a8f07b0b86b7348a53be11abbebc80f2df626f.jpg"}],"total":67},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1869290?t=1771371034","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1869290?t=1771371034","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869290/739119c7987fd11dfbedaa99eb32feb24629d06a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771371034","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869290/739119c7987fd11dfbedaa99eb32feb24629d06a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771371034","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play an apprentice of the solver's guild. Solvers are the most important people in this world because puzzle storms are rising all over the place, making people's lives harder. You're challenged with graduating your solver's exam by saving the princess from the nearby castle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869290/extras/4dc8941d591b3318eefaa6d343b3ed1c.poster.avif?t=1771371034\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869290/extras/4dc8941d591b3318eefaa6d343b3ed1c.webm?t=1771371034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869290/extras/4dc8941d591b3318eefaa6d343b3ed1c.mp4?t=1771371034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supraworld is a First-Person-Puzzle-Metroidvania. The interconnected world will expand the more upgrades and abilities you find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is filled to the brim with secret areas for you to find. Instead of invisible walls blocking you everywhere, the geometry you see is exactly what you get and what you can use for your traversal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869290/extras/10ae6b41c84e508c3f8f690c514f53f9.poster.avif?t=1771371034\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869290/extras/10ae6b41c84e508c3f8f690c514f53f9.webm?t=1771371034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869290/extras/10ae6b41c84e508c3f8f690c514f53f9.mp4?t=1771371034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is pretty much no useless decoration in the game. Everything you see is there for a specific reason; and it's not to clutter up your monitor with useless details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new addition to the franchise are detective cases. In those you're freely deducing who commited one of five murders and you're free to lock up whoever you think is the culprit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869290/extras/e5e1f71c873c387733e9bf9abae54e9a.poster.avif?t=1771371034\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869290/extras/e5e1f71c873c387733e9bf9abae54e9a.webm?t=1771371034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869290/extras/e5e1f71c873c387733e9bf9abae54e9a.mp4?t=1771371034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the time is spent exploring, solving puzzles and doing detective work. Combat is a relatively small part of the game and is sometimes also puzzle heavy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869290/extras/8c72ecb6eb7b6c6e463e7f3f77eef51d.poster.avif?t=1771371034\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869290/extras/8c72ecb6eb7b6c6e463e7f3f77eef51d.webm?t=1771371034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869290/extras/8c72ecb6eb7b6c6e463e7f3f77eef51d.mp4?t=1771371034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supraworld trusts you to be clever and is not holding your hand. Therefore the target audience are experienced players who are tired of the same old generic adventure games and are longing for something that challenges and surprises them in new ways</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Supra Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869290/header.jpg?t=1771371034","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"